  "name": "Sun Cleric Vow of Radiance adds 25% Holyfire damage and healing, 50% under Dawn (#9974)",
  "contract": [
    "Vow of Radiance 803489 reads 'Direct ability damage or healing generates 2 Solar Power and damages or heals",
    "for an additional $s2% of the amount' (s2 = 25) and 'Fulfillment: Doubles the damage or healing done'; its",
    "buff reads 'Direct damage or healing deals an additional 25% Holyflame damage or healing'. The bonus is a",
    "separate Holyfire instance, so the original hit is unchanged: 803490 deals 25% of a direct hit and 803816",
    "heals 25% of a direct heal's effective healing. A heal under Dawn 807440 fulfills the Vow and doubles the",
    "copy to 50%. Ratios allow truncation of the percentage to whole points, so the probes are a spell-power",
    "scaled heal and Frostbolt rank 42842, whose amounts make that truncation smaller than 0.2%."
  ],
